---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro'; import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="Admissions"><PageHero eyebrow="Admissions" title="The first step is a conversation." intro="Call or send a general inquiry. We will learn what you are looking for and explain the next appropriate step." image="/images/admissions.jpg" imageAlt="A notebook and cup on a clean table in a quiet room" />
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">How to begin</p><h2>A clear, private starting point.</h2><p class="lead">You do not need to send your full history through the website. Start with your name, contact information, and whether you are calling for yourself, a loved one, or a client.</p></div><ol class="steps grid-3"><li class="card"><span>1</span><h3>Reach out</h3><p>Call 412-628-0403 or send the short inquiry form below.</p></li><li class="card"><span>2</span><h3>Talk with us</h3><p>We will discuss your general needs and explain the current intake process.</p></li><li class="card"><span>3</span><h3>Review next steps</h3><p>If a New Beginnings residence may be appropriate, exact location and required information are shared privately.</p></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="section section--tint"><div class="container grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you submit</p><h2>Protect your private information.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">The website form is only for an initial inquiry.</p><p>Do not include diagnoses, medication information, treatment records, criminal-history details, Social Security numbers, or other sensitive information. Those details should only be discussed through an appropriate private intake process.</p><p>If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911. If you or someone else is in emotional distress or at risk of suicide, call or text 988.</p></div></div></section><InquiryForm title="Begin a housing inquiry" /></MainLayout>
<style>.steps { counter-reset: steps; padding: 0; list-style: none; }.steps span { color: var(--blue-600); font-weight: 750; }</style>
